# .gitignore for core-assets

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated PNG files (regenerated from scripts)
# Keep ICO in git as it's production-ready.
# In-app branding bitmaps under branding/ are SOURCE (not generated)
# and the tauri/ tree is a generated platform-icon set that we
# intentionally commit so consumer Tauri projects don't have to
# regenerate. Both are exceptions to the blanket *.png ignore.
*.png
!aic-icon-preview.png
!branding/*.png
!icons/tauri/**/*.png

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Build artifacts
*.log

# MaxMind GeoLite2: MSI/lab ship GeoLite2-Country.mmdb from the local build
# host (Update-MaxMindGeoLite.ps1 → sync → WiX stage). Do not commit .mmdb
# to git (MaxMind redistribution terms + large binary). Scratch:
geoip/*.mmdb.tmp
geoip/*.tar.gz
*.mmdb
geoip/*.mmdb.sha256

# MaxMind license key (GitHub secret scanning). Tracked constants omit the key.
geoip/maxmind-constants.local.toml
